    "detailed_description": "This game follows the story of a sentient cube lost within a mysterious facility.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2>The main scene behind this game resembles a flappy bird spin-off in a robotic environment, devoid of any biological life. This game also includes various other features, such as:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mana Orb Collection [in-game currency]</li><li>Smart obstacles</li><li>Enemies &amp; bosses</li><li>Unlockable upgrades &amp; skins</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What else?</h2>This game also hides various puzzles and secrets within itself. Use tools available to you to learn more about this facility you've been trapped in. Discover other simulated experiences left behind by previous employees, investigate old information packages, and much more!<br><br>This game is a recreation of a previous game made by us, which is no longer available to download.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085860/extras/d99695d4af3bd4897f2416c57fc57bef.avif?t=1733480104\" width=480 height=161 /></span>",
